<p>Fire a powerful shot at a foe doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">194%, 213%, 227%, 239%, 250%</acronym> weapon damage.</p><p>If the creature, or any creatures in radius 3, was affected by a fear or nightmare effect it violently wakes up, shaking it off only to find itself disoriented, unable to discern friends from foes for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p>